            <ArticleTitle>[Experience using clinical games in training in clinical surgery].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>5-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The method of business games developed and used for 5 years may be used successfully in practical training of late-year students of medical institutes in surgery. It expands the possibility of the traditional training methods essentially, promotes better learning of the material, the formation of skill in diagnosis and reaching practical decisions, and acquiring experience in contact with the patients and their relatives.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
